<title>CHINA: M.Stanley sets warrants on Cheung Kong.</title>
<headline>M.Stanley sets warrants on Cheung Kong.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd said on Wednesday it launched 60 million warrants on shares of Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE   HK$84.79	 PREMIUM	  13.78 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE    HK$1.1127	GEARING	  7.3X</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT HK$80.75	 PAYDATE	  19.AUG.97</p>
<p> MATURITY	 29.MAY.98	MIN. EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	  HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE	     PHYSICAL SHARES OR CASH AT ISSUER'S OPTION.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
